<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - SBC starts Ganadero, Industrial.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - SBC starts Ganadero, Industrial.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- SBC Warburg said it started coverage of Colombia's Banco Ganadero with a buy recommendation, saying it was well placed to take advantage of the market's potential.</p>
<p>-- The brokerage started Banco Industrial Colombiano with a hold rating. &quot;We believe the stock is fairly valued at current levels,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
